# open62541-qnx change: listen-numeric-name
# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
#
# title: No reverse DNS query for the wildcard address at server start
# file: open62541.c
# upstream: arch/eventloop_posix_tcp.c
# test: core.startup (time to start the server)
#
# For every listen socket the code asks getnameinfo() for the name of the
# address it binds to, which is the wildcard address in the default
# configuration, and uses the answer in a log line only. On a target whose
# resolver cannot reach a DNS server each of these queries runs into the
# resolver timeout before the server starts to listen.
#
@@ hunk
